      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-deps7:013",
        "answer": "Accept str_type,str_scenedef and implicit self for the fallback. Choose get_scenedef(str_scenedef) when the explicit name is defined; otherwise call get_scenedef(self.scriptbundlename). Set n_count to 0 after that fetch. Iterate every s_scenedef.objects element; only elements with defined type evaluate tolower(type)==tolower(str_type), and each match increments n_count once. Return the count after the loop. No skip for disabled objects or active-player/runtime checks exists locally. No guard validates the returned definition, objects container, str_type, self or string types.",
        "unknowns": [
          "actual bundle objects and effective types",
          "get_scenedef data/provider failure behavior retained in reused records",
          "VM foreach and tolower on malformed values",
          "self binding when name is omitted"
        ],
        "status": "complete_bounded_contract"
      },
